{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1000_p", "source_sha256": "91476c97c76ba7c1b8dbca9aed472df5d79cbf296a096c2815cf39d37ed9efde", "ja": "（風花のステージが終わった。ライブの後に\n話があると言われたけど、改まってなんだろう？）", "zh": "（风花的舞台结束了。她说演出后有话要和我谈，可为什么要这么郑重其事呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fe60bfea7cb21a73879836c3452528fb69cb9d7948bf3bac580e9251d6f8f300", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\nすみません、わざわざ来てもらって……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n不好意思，还特意让你跑一趟……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1002_p", "source_sha256": "43e5eb16cf675c07583296e3d9aa9e273cbd595165be60248c388a265f92ce35", "ja": "いや、全然かまわないよ。それで、話って？", "zh": "没事，完全不碍事的。那么，找我有什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f6304d6cabc46a7d31efcde2de9ccbf0308324e93b45d6bf42460c6da21f9ad2", "ja": "はい。実はこの前、以前勤めていた病院の人たちから、\n手紙が届いたんです。", "zh": "是的。其实前几天，我收到了以前工作过的那家医院的人寄来的信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1004_p", "source_sha256": "93d2fb7ce81701a1819ed8276fadb6ca9c517b8d401a5e00ed61b41ad6eeb4bd", "ja": "病院……というと、看護師時代の？", "zh": "说到医院……是你当护士时的那家？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6502a4cc50b400dc4d044e8412b23da4e7e317095ceeb4d6d0e281c6fc3180fe", "ja": "ええ。\n看護師仲間や、担当してた患者さんからです。", "zh": "是的。\n是以前共事的护士，还有我负责过的患者们送的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "584d9fee26924d91005798e23c0d4435b1751e6fd2bc88abdd1ef97e102b05c8", "ja": "アイドルデビューしてからも、ずっと見てたよって。\n看護師を辞めたあとも、見守ってくれていたんですね。", "zh": "他们说，自从我偶像出道后，就一直在关注着我。\n没想到在我辞去护士工作后，他们也一直在守望着我呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0d401c593afda28cf2da3e275aedd320cac66f1ac318f039f7087bdbf2937e97", "ja": "私、とってもうれしくなってしまって。\nそれで、{$P$}さんにお話が……。", "zh": "我啊，高兴得不得了。\n然后，就跟{$P$}先生说起这件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2e886a569fb00c6d4837f6e6f58e56fef800268a81126399c4261dc1e8165fb4", "ja": "（……ん？　この流れ、まさか……）", "zh": "（……嗯？照这个发展，难道……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1afb42bc673c19d9c88fb774fc4a476a15694eaf675e2c9513ae56aa507467c4", "ja": "あの……今日まで、本当にありがとうございました！", "zh": "那个……一直以来，真的非常感谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c864ef52882471eabc9facda0baa415167127b91ba6f7a12e0690e539ddd665a", "ja": "私、アイドルになれて本当に良かったです。これも\n全部、{$P$}さんのおかげです……。", "zh": "我真的很庆幸自己能成为偶像。这一切都是托{$P$}先生的福……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "758894a798a591671202c6ebb8c0359179cc4379c2bab77db26dfdf76db28342", "ja": "セクシーなお仕事もたくさんありましたけど……\nそれも、私のことを考えてくれてだと思いますし。", "zh": "虽然也接过很多性感的工作……\n但我想，那也是因为您有替我考虑吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1012_p", "source_sha256": "dc2a1fe484c6ae3160f55dcacd855048d6ccb654ed1aaae5dccfb2ebc920d97f", "ja": "（もしかして……アイドルをやめて、\n前の職場に戻るっていう話なのか……！？）", "zh": "（难道……是在说要放弃偶像的工作，回到之前的工作单位吗……！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5cbbab7e45de461c054975c9ee021d795cf5a949f0f6da7e1601b6d1692da50a", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nこれからも、アイドルの私を支えてくださいね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n今后作为偶像的我，也请您多多支持哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b0399b152ccddf0486fee537c27845b5f672c48363db1c3af5bf5ff7c0764c02", "ja": "え？　……あ、ああ、そういう事か！\nもちろん、こちらこそよろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "咦？……啊，原来是这么回事！\n当然了，我才要请你多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "338fd475d85bb8f265e4c4d29ec984ab4fe85cd3e995777f8c58077d4e36e533", "ja": "え……？　あの、{$P$}さん、\nどうかしましたか？　すごい汗ですけど……。", "zh": "咦……？那个，{$P$}先生，您怎么了？出了好多汗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ac0ffc1031634c16344833537d94b031f783912bfb9d4f86fd0471d3d41cde8c", "ja": "もしかして、風邪ですか？\n大変、熱を測らないと。", "zh": "难道是感冒了吗？\n不好，得量一下体温才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b8ba0f5e65ed0c006ac9b8ec882f892bcbe71fd8abbcfcf3a5bd35b8000e3676", "ja": "いや、違うんだ。風花がずいぶん改まってたから、\nちょっと身構えちゃっただけだよ。", "zh": "不，不是的。是因为风花那么郑重其事，\n我才稍微有些紧张罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "dcb6736387a94c30ad6025bfd5e1bedcc7c2ab138e16d811848b0e3696892110", "ja": "あっ……ごめんなさい！\n私、なんだか感極まっちゃって……。", "zh": "啊……对不起！\n我、我不知怎么的有点感动过头了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "439cc76baec3d6713c845603caa632067b16be964ded6e0f06d6ee0f3286ef31", "ja": "手紙を読んでから、{$P$}さんに\nずっとお礼が言いたかったんです。", "zh": "读完信后，我一直想向{$P$}先生道谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1020_p", "source_sha256": "9721ab3cbda54500d2559b91c2c7fd2d32f0cf165a713b0895cb3cfcd31fcfe6", "ja": "でも、そういうことなら良かった。\nこれからもよろしくな、風花！", "zh": "不过，既然是这么回事，那就太好了。今后也请多多关照，风花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b10a194e637725446eff1cfe8e411941858b6ebcbab6ca1e7dbc5d7bc433ba5f", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます！\n私、がんばりますね♪", "zh": "好的，谢谢你！我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0164_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f93e175198090f0d3323730cabe0085dbe56ca4fd12dedb38d7644c5d8ad7fba", "ja": "（一瞬ドキッとしたけど、杞憂で済んで良かった……。\n風花にとっては昔と同じくらい、今も大事なんだな！）", "zh": "（虽然有一瞬间心里一惊，但还好只是我杞人忧天……\n对风花来说，现在也和过去一样重要啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
